OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry start
OL,6,Fto the evening but rain will spread
OL,7,Fnorth later in the evening accompanied
OL,8,Fby freshening winds, rain heavy in the
OL,9,Feast for a time. Staying rather wet
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FRain clearing from the west
OL,13,Fduring the morning with some bright or
OL,14,Fsunny spells for the afternoon, still
OL,15,Fquite breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
