OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FRather
OL,6,Funsettled over the weekend, rain and
OL,7,Fstrong winds spread east Saturday
OL,8,Fmorning. Gales Saturday night and
OL,9,Ffurther blustery showers on Sunday.
OL,10,FLikely further outbreaks of rain on
OL,11,FMonday.
